From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 14:34:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] (halium) Add Java module disabling via pre-arch mutator

Disable ~55 Java module types before OS/arch variant explosion.
Modify arch transitions to return empty variant for disabled modules.
Add halium_ignored_modules.list glob patterns for module filtering.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ic365efd6f8ea957df39789b9d7d9b8e4801a8deb
